ll, appear in front of her. Later, Moga sneaks into Kuromajo Gakuen to save Rina after she was kidnapped. There, Moga sees a girl who once stayed with her at Shiromajo Gakuen.","poster_path":"/nvn1ZNZnk5geM4B0gW0TLOICTKs.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[14,18,28],"popularity":0.5172,"release_date":"2015-06-15","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.0,"vote_count":2}]},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":3557384,"known_for_department":"Camera","name":"Usa Manitanon","original_name":"Usa Manitanon","popularity":0.2049,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/nq1ekNmx6jXjxRfbcuQn4hKSCXA.jpg","id":623618,"title":"Tee Shot: Ariya Jutanugarn","original_title":"โปรเม อัจฉริยะ/ต้อง/สร้าง","overview":"This biopic follows pro golfer Ariya Jutanugarn's journey to the LPGA tour, from child prodigy to her number-one ranking in the world.","poster_path":"/ib34FBDdtp24fEftphT8y7TGarT.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"th","genre_ids":[18],"popularity":0.6742,"release_date":"2019-08-15","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":4.9,"vote_count":5},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/xQfLqWPEZoClgfVxxr6AnWVswgB.jpg","id":1306482,"title":"Isan Nikah","original_title":"ผู้บ่าวนิกะห์","overview":"The wedding story of a southern Muslim bride named Sofia with her Isan university senior Khai who is Buddhist. The two have cultural and religious differences, but it doesn't seem like they'll pose much of a problem given the strength of their love.","poster_path":"/vdrvB75wlxnUtDgyEleca9SlRr0.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"th","genre_ids":[35,10749,18],"popularity":0.4683,"release_date":"2024-12-19","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.0,"vote_count":2},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/hRbmgBQD5XlNs33mtE5FMTqyb7r.jpg","id":394978,"title":"Grace","original_title":"อวสานโลกสวย","overview":"Jealous over an internet idol who rises to viral fame, a faded star and her obsessed fan hatch a devious plan that yields unexpected results.","poster_path":"/tkQWduBdVKAiPLcZ4YpmudPUvWh.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"th","genre_ids":[53],"popularity":0.6605,"release_date":"2016-01-21","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":4.5,"vote_count":2}]},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":3810723,"known_for_department":"Art","name":"K. Usa","original_name":"K. Usa","popularity":0.0732,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/piMRImsn3ZQerFmPdAoXgmOpc7R.jpg","id":127714,"name":"Uncle from Another World","original_name":"異世界おじさん","overview":"After being in a coma for 17 years, Takafumi's middle-aged uncle suddenly wakes up speaking an unrecognizable language and wielding magical powers.","poster_path":"/ixYH9Ngm3IcPtK4964jbvB0Czi9.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[16,35,10765],"popularity":8.1997,"first_air_date":"2022-07-06","softcore":false,"vote_average":7.461,"vote_count":153,"origin_country":["JP"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/9C8klg2GszX2tXKw5xEzJwrL4Do.jpg","id":154524,"name":"Urusei Yatsura","original_name":"うる星やつら","overview":"Tokyo, Tomobiki Town. Lum, the gorgeous princess of the invading alien race of Oni is smitten with high school student Ataru Moroboshi. A dedicated womanizer, Ataru is unfazed by Lum’s fierce electric shock attacks and continues his daily hunt for pretty girls. With a host of other unique characters, including girl-next-door Shinobu, elegant shrine maiden Sakura, Lum’s best friends Oyuki, Benten, and Ran, Buddhist Monk Cherry, Ten, the little brat, heir to a wealthy family Shutaro Mendo and the masculine beauty Ryunosuke…it's a classic slapstick love comedy where anything goes!","poster_path":"/zK82mkrePHoixlYzsr9mUPchBxX.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"ja","genre_ids":[16,35,10759,10765],"popularity":20.3889,"first_air_date":"2022-10-14","softcore":false,"vote_average":6.833,"vote_count":48,"origin_country":["JP"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/xDd7eha6XFOO6IQn