","original_title":"สามพราน","overview":"Two brothers from a policeman's family are living their contrasted morals: Thep, the elder one, drinks his life away while Pongthai, his younger brother, is trying hard to be a good cop. One night, their dad was gunned down by opium gangsters, the very night Thep had a fight with him and fled the house with anger. Pongthai and others now believe his delinquent brother is a killer.","poster_path":"/lee2Onm2eJf2t3QEf9v7Br0nEPT.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"th","genre_ids":[],"popularity":0.7942,"release_date":"1960-10-12","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"id":1742313,"title":"The Bandit","original_title":"The Bandit","overview":"A beautiful young woman from the capital flees after committing a crime and heads to a remote backwater, hoping to seek refuge with her uncle. On the journey, she and a young doctor traveling on the same bus are captured by a band of outlaws. It is soon revealed that the gang’s leader abducted the doctor to treat his beloved wife, who is gravely ill. While held captive, the young woman and the doctor secretly plot their escape, aided by the bandit chief’s wife, who also longs to break free. When the opportunity finally arises, the three flee together, leaving the furious bandit leader to launch a relentless manhunt across the countryside.","poster_path":"/xBqoU4JHWazogmUIpaz3MisqzV.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"th","genre_ids":[12,18],"popularity":0.0286,"release_date":"1961-03-29","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0}]},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":4485218,"known_for_department":"Camera","name":"Jason USA","original_name":"Jason USA","popularity":0.0526,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"id":1232253,"title":"Dan O'Neill And The Air Pirates: A Short Film","original_title":"Dan O'Neill And The Air Pirates: A Short Film","overview":"This is